    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span><span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">String scan</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Hash map</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/roman-to-integer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 13</a></div>\n  <h1>Roman to Integer</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: a symbol is subtracted exactly when the symbol right after it is bigger, otherwise it is added. One left-to-right pass with a one-symbol lookahead: O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
